00:02:01.718 --> 00:02:02.650
(bell ringing)

00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:03.483
A hair.

00:02:05.330 --> 00:02:06.760
Oh, brushing your teeth.

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:07.593
A toothbrush.

00:02:07.593 --> 00:02:08.679
(bell ringing)

00:02:08.679 --> 00:02:12.190
- Okay, so Aidy's giving
the clues this time,

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:14.870
so mute her mic and let's go.

00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:15.703
Here we go.

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:21.470
Corn on the cob, oh, flossing,
flossing, dental floss.

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:24.630
(bell ringing)

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:26.173
Phone number, calling.

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:28.090
Phone call.

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:28.923
Answer the phone.

00:02:28.923 --> 00:02:29.962
iPhone? iPhone?

00:02:29.962 --> 00:02:32.712
